{"seq":1,"slug":"dreamer-family","title":"Dreamer 系列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/dreamer-family","wordCount":2051,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"dreamer-系列\">Dreamer 系列</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Dreamer 是当前最成功的世界模型范式之一，由 Danijar Hafner 等人从 2020 年开始持续推进。其核心思想是：把高维观察压缩到低维隐空间，在隐空间学习动力学模型，然后通过&quot;想象 rollout&quot;在内部模型中训练 actor-critic 策略。这种&quot;在脑中想象&quot;的训练方式让 Dreamer 在样本效率上显著优于纯 model-free RL，并在 Atari、DeepMind Control、Minecraft 等极其多样的环境中都取得了顶尖水平。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[观察 o_t] --&gt; B[编码器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[隐状态 z_t]&#10;    D[动作 a_t] --&gt; E[RSSM 动力学]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;预测 z_{t+1}&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;解码器/奖励/价值预测&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[想象 rollout]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Actor-Critic 训练]\">graph LR\n    A[观察 o_t] --&gt; B[编码器]\n    B --&gt; C[隐状态 z_t]\n    D[动作 a_t] --&gt; E[RSSM 动力学]\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"预测 z_{t+1}\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"解码器/奖励/价值预测\"]\n    F --&gt; H[想象 rollout]\n    H --&gt; I[Actor-Critic 训练]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>发布时间</th>\n<th>关键贡献</th>\n<th>性能突破</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Dreamer V1</td>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>RSSM + 想象训练框架</td>\n<td>DeepMind Control 上接近最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dreamer V2</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n<td>离散隐状态、KL 平衡</td>\n<td>Atari 200M 上超越 Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dreamer V3</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>统一超参、对称对数变换、自适应 KL</td>\n<td>Minecraft 钻石获取（无人能及）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dreamer 4</td>\n<td>2025.09</td>\n<td>Transformer 世界模型、想象内训练</td>\n<td>仅靠想象训练收集 Minecraft 钻石</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rssm-递归状态空间模型\">RSSM：递归状态空间模型</h2><p>Dreamer 的核心组件是 RSSM（Recurrent State-Space Model）——一个把隐状态分解为确定性和随机两部分的递归网络。形式化地，隐状态由两部分组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确定性部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：通过 GRU 累积的历史信息。</li>\n<li>随机部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：通过 KL 散度学到的随机变量，捕捉环境的不确定性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>完整的 RSSM 更新方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>GRU</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t = \\text{GRU}(h_{t-1}, z_{t-1}, a_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GRU</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(prior)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t \\sim p(z_t | h_t) \\quad \\text{(prior)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(prior)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(posterior)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t \\sim q(z_t | h_t, o_t) \\quad \\text{(posterior)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(posterior)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>训练时通过最小化变分下界（ELBO）让 prior 接近 posterior，确保隐空间能从历史预测当前。这一设计让 RSSM 既能处理确定性的长期依赖（通过 GRU），又能建模随机性（通过 z）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"想象训练-dreamer-的核心创新\">想象训练：Dreamer 的核心创新</h2><p>传统 model-based RL 用模型生成数据补充真实数据训练 model-free 算法。Dreamer 的创新是：完全不在真实环境上训练策略，而是只在世界模型内部&quot;想象 rollout&quot;训练。具体流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[真实数据] --&gt; B[训练世界模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C[世界模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[从隐状态出发想象 H 步]&#10;    D --&gt; E[每个想象状态的奖励/价值预测]&#10;    E --&gt; F[计算 actor-critic 损失]&#10;    F --&gt; G[更新 actor 与 critic]&#10;    G --&gt; H[新策略生成新真实数据]&#10;    H --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[真实数据] --&gt; B[训练世界模型]\n    B --&gt; C[世界模型]\n    C --&gt; D[从隐状态出发想象 H 步]\n    D --&gt; E[每个想象状态的奖励/价值预测]\n    E --&gt; F[计算 actor-critic 损失]\n    F --&gt; G[更新 actor 与 critic]\n    G --&gt; H[新策略生成新真实数据]\n    H --&gt; A</pre><p>想象训练的好处：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据效率</strong>：真实交互只用于训练世界模型，策略训练完全在内部进行。</li>\n<li><strong>可微规划</strong>：想象 rollout 是完全可微的计算图，可以反向传播梯度。</li>\n<li><strong>任意 horizon</strong>：想象长度可以远超真实 episode 长度，让策略学到长期规划。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>想象训练的局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>模型偏差累积</strong>：想象多步后世界模型的预测误差累积，远期想象不可靠。</li>\n<li><strong>OOD 状态</strong>：策略在想象中可能进入世界模型未见过的状态，预测变得不可靠。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dreamer V3 通过加入对称对数变换（让奖励的尺度不影响超参）和自适应 KL（让随机性自动平衡）等技巧，显著提升了想象训练的稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离散隐状态-dreamer-v2-的关键改进\">离散隐状态：Dreamer V2 的关键改进</h2><p>Dreamer V1 使用连续高斯隐状态。Dreamer V2 改为离散隐状态——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 表示为 32 个 32 路的分类分布，相当于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>32</mn><mn>32</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32^{32}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个可能值。这一改动看似简单，但在 Atari 上带来了显著性能提升。</p>\n<p>离散隐状态的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>更强的表达能力</strong>：相比连续高斯，离散分布能精确捕捉多模态。</li>\n<li><strong>更稳定的训练</strong>：避免连续分布的方差爆炸问题。</li>\n<li><strong>直通梯度（Straight-Through）</strong>：通过 ST-estimator 让离散变量也能反向传播。</li>\n<li><strong>隐式正则化</strong>：离散隐状态的有限容量天然防止过拟合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一选择启发了后续大量世界模型工作——Genie、世界模型部分都使用离散隐状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dreamer-v3-统一超参的工程突破\">Dreamer V3：统一超参的工程突破</h2><p>Dreamer V2 仍然需要为每个任务调超参。V3 的目标是&quot;一套超参解决所有任务&quot;——不论 Atari、Control、Minecraft，都用同一组配置。这一目标听起来简单，但工程难度极大，需要解决：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>奖励尺度差异</strong>：Atari 奖励几十、Control 奖励小数、Minecraft 奖励上千。V3 用对称对数变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>symlog</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>sign</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{symlog}(x) = \\text{sign}(x) \\log(|x|+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">symlog</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sign</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把不同尺度奖励映射到相似范围。</li>\n<li><strong>KL 不平衡</strong>：随机部分和确定部分的 KL 自适应权重，让训练自动找到合适平衡。</li>\n<li><strong>价值函数稳定</strong>：用 EMA 目标网络 + 离散值预测进一步稳定训练。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>V3 的工程价值是显著的——研究者不再需要为每个新任务调超参，世界模型从&quot;研究 demo&quot;走向&quot;通用工具&quot;。Dreamer V3 在 Minecraft 钻石获取这个超长时序任务上取得了独有突破，证明了想象训练能力的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dreamer-4-transformer-世界模型与想象内训练-2025\">Dreamer 4：Transformer 世界模型与想象内训练（2025）</h2><p>Dreamer 4（Hafner 等，2025 年 9 月，arXiv:2509.24527《Training Agents Inside of Scalable World Models》）是系列的第四代，做了两个根本性改变：</p>\n<p><strong>动力学骨干从 GRU-RSSM 换成 Transformer</strong>。观测被 patch 化为时空 token，模型对 token 序列做 next-token 预测来学习动力学，随机性通过离散 token 的采样天然表达。给定动作序列，轨迹的生成概率分解为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_\\theta(\\tau) = \\prod_{t=1}^{T} \\prod_{i} p_\\theta\\left(z_t^i \\mid z_{&lt;t},\\, z_t^{&lt;i},\\, a_{&lt;t}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_t^i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0717em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 帧的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个时空 token。这一改动让世界模型能像 LLM 一样随参数与数据规模扩展。</p>\n<p><strong>Shortcut forcing 训练技巧</strong>。纯自回归长 rollout 训练代价极高，Dreamer 4 用短上下文训练、推理时却能稳定展开长时序想象（机制细节以论文为准），解决了 Transformer 世界模型&quot;训练短、想象长&quot;的工程矛盾。</p>\n<p>最关键的实验主张是<strong>完全在想象中训练</strong>：agent 在 VPT 人类游玩数据训练的世界模型内部学习，论文报告不与真实 Minecraft 环境交互即完成钻石收集，超过模仿学习与 RL 基线；同时模型可在单张 GPU 上实时运行想象（性能数字以论文为准）。这与 Genie 3 的实时交互世界共同指向 2025 年的一个共识——世界模型正在从&quot;策略训练的辅助组件&quot;升级为&quot;可进入的环境本身&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在机器人上的应用\">在机器人上的应用</h2><p>Dreamer 系列从 2023 年开始扩展到真实机器人任务：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DayDreamer</strong>：在真实机器人上训练 Dreamer，仅 1 小时真实交互就让四足机器人学会行走。</li>\n<li><strong>TD-MPC2</strong>：把 Dreamer 思想与 MPC 结合，在机器人控制上获得最佳效果。</li>\n<li><strong>Diffusion World Model</strong>：用扩散模型替代 RSSM，处理复杂物理动力学。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>机器人应用证明了 Dreamer 范式不仅在仿真有效，在真实物理世界也能产生工程价值。这一进展让世界模型从纯学术研究走向实用化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其他世界模型路线的比较\">与其他世界模型路线的比较</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Dreamer</th>\n<th>MuZero</th>\n<th>JEPA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐空间训练</td>\n<td>重建 + 奖励</td>\n<td>价值 + 奖励 + 策略</td>\n<td>仅特征预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规划方法</td>\n<td>想象 rollout</td>\n<td>MCTS 树搜索</td>\n<td>通常不直接规划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>连续/离散控制</td>\n<td>离散决策（特别是棋类）</td>\n<td>自监督预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（树搜索）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Dreamer 在样本效率与通用性上有平衡优势，是当前应用最广泛的世界模型范式。但在某些特定场景（如棋类）MuZero 仍然占优；JEPA 提供了不同的预训练思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Dreamer 系列代表了潜空间世界模型的最成功实践。从 V1 建立 RSSM + 想象训练框架，到 V2 的离散隐状态，再到 V3 的统一超参、以及 2025 年 Dreamer 4 的 Transformer 化与想象内训练，每一代都解决了上一代的关键痛点。理解 Dreamer 的核心组件（RSSM、想象训练、对称对数变换）能让研究者把握世界模型的工程化路径。Dreamer 已经证明了&quot;在低维隐空间学习动力学并在内部规划&quot;是可行且通用的方法论；Dreamer 4 之后，研究焦点已经从&quot;能否在想象中训练&quot;转向&quot;想象的世界能扩展到多大、多真实&quot;。把 Dreamer 作为世界模型研究的入门基准，是任何具身智能研究者的必修课。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Dreamer 系列","id":"dreamer-系列"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RSSM：递归状态空间模型","id":"rssm-递归状态空间模型"},{"level":2,"text":"想象训练：Dreamer 的核心创新","id":"想象训练-dreamer-的核心创新"},{"level":2,"text":"离散隐状态：Dreamer V2 的关键改进","id":"离散隐状态-dreamer-v2-的关键改进"},{"level":2,"text":"Dreamer V3：统一超参的工程突破","id":"dreamer-v3-统一超参的工程突破"},{"level":2,"text":"Dreamer 4：Transformer 世界模型与想象内训练（2025）","id":"dreamer-4-transformer-世界模型与想象内训练-2025"},{"level":2,"text":"在机器人上的应用","id":"在机器人上的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他世界模型路线的比较","id":"与其他世界模型路线的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"MuZero 与基于模型的规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/muzero-and-planning"}}